# Force LF line endings for ALL text files in this repo.
# This repo is consumed by NixOS/Linux, where CRLF silently breaks shell
# shebangs (#!/bin/bash\r -> "bash\r: No such file or directory") and Lua/config
# parsers. The global Git setting core.autocrlf=true on Windows would otherwise
# re-corrupt the working tree on every checkout, so we pin eol=lf explicitly.
* text=auto eol=lf
